WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.880
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:04.510
LARRY P. ARNN:
Learning is hard work.

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:08.020
Hard work requires character.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:09.550
Learning begins in faith.

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:12.010
It must move upward
towards the highest thing,

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:13.990
unseen at the beginning--

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:15.190
God.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:17.350
And freedom is
essential to learning.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.110
Its principles must be
studied and defended.

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:23.450
Learning, character,
faith, and freedom--

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:27.330
these are the inseparable
purposes of Hillsdale College.

